sequenceDiagram
  title Outbox retry and ACK
  participant SenderAI as Sender AI
  participant postal_sendTool as postal_send Tool
  participant OutboxKV as Outbox KV
  participant RetryScanner as Retry Scanner
  participant PeerSession as Peer Session
  autonumber 1 3
  SenderAI->>postal_sendTool: postal_send letter
  postal_sendTool->>OutboxKV: mark delivered
  postal_sendTool->>OutboxKV: write pending record
  alt delivery succeeds
    PeerSession->>postal_sendTool: reply with reply_to
    postal_sendTool->>PeerSession: attempt steer
    postal_sendTool->>OutboxKV: mark acked
  else delivery fails
    postal_sendTool->>OutboxKV: pending with backoff
    loop every 15 seconds
      RetryScanner->>OutboxKV: list due records
      RetryScanner->>PeerSession: retry steer
      alt retry succeeds
        RetryScanner->>OutboxKV: mark delivered
      else attempts below six
        RetryScanner->>OutboxKV: schedule next backoff
      else attempts exhausted
        RetryScanner->>OutboxKV: mark failed
      end
    end
  end